    {
      "name": "architecture",
      "value": {
        "principles": "Measure, then cut. Work proportional to change, not to the size of the world: read only taps that grew, only bg records that are running, only what a tick needs. Every buffer has a bound. Every fix keeps the observable behaviour (signals, completions, deliveries) identical and is proven so."
      }
